  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Migrant Children Travel to School!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Migrant children in Thailand face many barriers to education. One of these barriers that the children are facing right now is no transport to their classes. This is due to the high cost of transportation for parents and guardians. It might seem to be a small issue, however one that seriously affects their access to education.   We need your help to fund a safe and free transport service for these children to get to school. Without such support, they will miss out on their education.</narrative>
  </description>
